        // - If it did not revert and we sent Ether directly to c (targetIsFallback==true), then afterBalance == beforeBalance + amount and afterCount == beforeCount + 1.
        // - If it did not revert and we used sendMoney with extTarget == address(c), then c's depositsCount increments by the number of fallback invocations caused (here exactly 1) and balance decreases by amount (sent out), i.e., afterBalance == beforeBalance - amount and afterCount == beforeCount + 1.
        assert(
            (reverted && afterCount == beforeCount && afterBalance == beforeBalance)
            || (
                !reverted && targetIsFallback && afterCount == beforeCount + 1 && afterBalance == beforeBalance + amount
